2.
Definitions.
- In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires;
(a)
"Act" means the National Highways Authority of India Act, 1988 (
68 of 1988
);
(b)
"Authority" means the National Highways Authority of India constituted under section 3 of the Act;
(c)
"Chairman" means the Chairman of the Authority;
(d)
"Member" means a member of the Authority appointed under section 3 of the Act and includes the Chairman;
(e)
words and expressions used herein and not defined but defined in the Act, shall have the meanings respectively
assigned to them in the Act.
(f)
[ Part-time Non-Government Members means a member appointed by Central Government under sub-section (3) of
section 3 of the Act.]
[Inserted by Notification No. G.S.R. 174(E), dated 5.3.2015 (w.e.f. 23.6.2003)]
